  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COVID-19 Health systems Preparedness and Response&#x2013; Testing and therapeutics</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Island Countries&#xa0;are supported by Aotearoa New Zealand to have&#xa0;access to supplies of Rapid Antigen Tests and accompanying technical support to screen for COVID-19.
The Cook Islands, Niue and Tokelau&#xa0;have access to&#xa0;COVID-19 antivirals (therapeutics) from Aotearoa New&#xa0;Zealand&#x2019;s domestic supply, subject to availability.
Other Pacific Island countries&#xa0;are&#xa0;supported with access to COVID-19 therapeutics and accompanying technical support&#xa0;by the World Health Organisation.</narrative>
  </description>
